{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The draft driver bootstraps three Peers, elects a leader through tick-driven voting, and processes updates before issuing reads. A fixed policy drops only the first request’s context-bearing heartbeats, allowing the later confirmation to release both pending requests. The check will compare each response’s context with its originating request, using destination identity rather than the context itself for correlation.\n"}}
